You are correct...  cursed or confused scroll of teleport will do
level teleport.  Also, the valkyrie quest artifact (Orb of Fate) can
be invoked for level teleport, and the Wizard quest artifact (Eye of
Aethiopica) can be invoked to create a one way portal to the lowest
discovered level of any dungeon branch you have explored.

Also, if you are not magic resistant (or can remove the objects giving
you MR) and walk into a level teleporter, you will be teleported to
another level.  Having TC will allow you to choose which level.

Lastly, a cursed potion of gain level will teleport you to the next
highest level of your current dungeon branch, if possible.  This fails
on the top level of Sokoban, the top level of Vlad's tower, and I
think the top level of the Wizard's tower.  Also, ALL forms of level
teleport are disabled on the planes except the normal magic portals
one uses to traverse the planes.

